- A Broken precedent with a reason I approved is not a finding. Send {% if implementer_agent %}`{{ implementer_agent }}`{% else %}the subagent that made the change{% endif %} the confirmed findings that are Critical or High, Broken precedents or duplicates,
  in one list, verbatim, then run a new wave; when nothing is left to send, the check is done. At most {{ review_rounds }} rework rounds.
- A finding that should go back but is still open after that is **UNRESOLVED** in phase 6, never done; a precedent still
