{% else %}**Conformance check.** After the {% if scope_guard %}scope{% else %}final{% endif %} check{% if adversary %}, and before the adversary check{% endif %}, check the whole change against the precedent list from phase 3 yourself: the project has no reviewer.
{% if worktree_implementer %}- Merge `{{ worktree_implementer }}`'s worktree branch into the working branch before each check, or it checks code without the change.
{% endif %}- Work from the goal, the approved plan, the precedent list verbatim, the base and the changed files. Each
